TITLE 1D transport with cation exchange

SOLUTION 1 Initial
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 2-10 Initial_cells
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 0 Inflow_boundary
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0

END
